	(property "Description" "Waveshare ESP32-C6-Zero, 18.0 x 23.5mm. Pads 1-9 = left edge from the USB socket: 5V GND 3V3 GP0 GP1 GP2 GP3 GP4 GP5; pads 10-18 = right edge from the antenna: GP22 GP21 GP20 GP19 GP18 GP15 GP14 RX TX; 2.54mm, rows 15.24mm apart. Pads 19-25 = underside pads from the antenna: GP6 GP7 GP8 GP9 GP23 GP12 GP13, 1.6mm, 3.63mm from the right edge. USB socket shell 1.2mm past the edge. From the maker's drawing."
